{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1516939-house-scathach-outside-of-fate","id":1516939,"title":"House Scathach outside of Fate?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-07-01T19:45:04-07:00","id":1516939,"title":"House Scathach outside of Fate?","content":"I have read in the past that House Scathach resides outside of fate, and can interfere with prophecy. Is that only the Autumn fae, or also the Arcadian ones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-02T00:56:32-07:00","id":1516949,"title":"","content":"That's... a slight misunderstanding. Per Book of Lost Houses, House Scathach doesn't see Fate's design as unchangeable, they see it as mutable, though not without cost for those who would change it. Only the House's highest ranks (5+) are trusted with the responsibility of interference, and doing so isn't presented in any sort of mechanical form. The House supports causes which foster freedom, dignity, and change.<br /> <br /> There's a five-dot Scathach merit, Phantom Fate, which gives a +3 to difficulty on all Soothsay cantrips used against the one who has it, positive or negative, makes them near-immune to the Omen cantrip, and prevents them from buying any luck-related merits or flaws. For those not of the House, the cost goes up two, and the moirae adhene can't take it at all and dislike those who do.<br /> <br /> It should be noted this was before C20's formalisation of the division between Arcadian and Autumn Sidhe, though even as presented in the Scathach chapter, Phantom Fate was available to both groups of Scathach.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}